      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think reporting the number of processes in direct reclaim would be too much unnecessary information for the userspace and it causes unnecessary wakeups. Let\u0027s keep the previous `direct_reclaim_state` interface where report \"1\" when procs_in_direct_reclaim\u003e0 and \"0\" when procs_in_direct_reclaim\u003d\u003d0. We should also wake up the userspace only when direct_reclaim_state transition happens from 0 to 1 or 1 to 0 happens, not on each procs_in_direct_reclaim increment/decrement.",
